  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed development is supported by inadequate and unsatisfactory compensatory flood storage to mitigate flood risk and inadequate drainage drawings which fail to show permeable paving and drainage details. As such, the development is contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), policies SI12 and SI13 of The London Plan (2021) and policies DM9 and DM10 of the Harrow Development Management Polices Local Plan (2013).&lt;/p&gt;"
